1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Investors face a familiar problem: one trading style can struggle
when markets change, while separate reports hide the portfolio’s
combined risks.

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Our proposed five-million-dollar paper fund combines equity
momentum, daily pairs trading and crypto. An Investment Committee
sets PM mandates under a human Board. AI representatives would
investigate diagnostics and explain the evidence.

3
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Our local prototype connects crypto and pairs with independent
risk checks. The prototype records intentions, with zero fills.
Historical crypto validation returned 10.09 percent after
modelled turnover costs, versus 10.77 percent for equal-weight
bitcoin and ether. Full-fund results remain pending.

4
00:00:45,000 --> 00:01:00,000
We invite you to assess a transparent paper pilot: inspect every
proposal, challenge every explanation, and judge the final out-
of-sample results. The goal is a fund you can understand and
audit.
